This user manual contains current Emacsvox operating guidance.  Begin with
Getting Started, then continue to Speech Backends and Basic Usage.  Exact
commands, options, and keymaps are in the separate
@ref{Top,Emacsvox Reference Manual,,emacsvox-reference,Emacsvox Reference
Manual}.  Selected historical Emacspeak material is in the separate
@ref{Top,Emacspeak Heritage,,emacsvox-heritage,Emacspeak Heritage} manual and
is not current setup guidance.  For rapidly evolving Omnivox and Aural
Presentation details, also consult @file{Readme.org} and
@file{etc/aural-presentation-reference.org} in the source tree.

